BT 1 0 0 1 0 39.5 Tm 12 TL /F2 8.5 Tf .117647 .160784 .231373 rg (1.1 What is COSMOSCOPE?) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf  T* (COSMOSCOPE is an open-science astronomical exploration and scientific analysis platform built for the NASA Space Apps Challenge.) Tj T* (It provides intuitive, browser-based tools that unlock genuine multi-epoch infrared observations captured by NASA's revolutionary) Tj T* (SPHEREx space telescope.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 42 649.3898 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 51.5 Tm 12 TL /F2 8.5 Tf .117647 .160784 .231373 rg (1.2 What Scientific Problem Does It Address?) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf  T* (Modern all-sky space telescopes generate petabytes of complex, multi-extension FITS data containing hundreds of spectral channels) Tj T* (and multiple observation dates. Historically, analyzing these multi-dimensional surveys required specialized astrophysics software,) Tj T* (command-line scripts, and large local compute clusters. COSMOSCOPE removes these technical barriers by providing a responsive,) Tj T* (zero-install research workbench where users can explore the dynamic infrared universe in real time.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 42 585.8898 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 51.5 Tm 12 TL /F2 8.5 Tf .117647 .160784 .231373 rg (1.3 What is the SPHEREx Mission?) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf  T* (SPHEREx \() Tj /F3 8.5 Tf (Spectro-Photometer for the History of the Universe, Epoch of Reionization and Ices Explorer) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf (\) is a NASA Medium-Class) Tj T* (Explorer \(MIDEX\) mission designed to conduct the first-ever all-sky near-infrared spectrophotometric survey. Operating in a 650 km) Tj T* (Sun-synchronous low-Earth polar orbit, SPHEREx maps the entire celestial sphere every 6 months across ) Tj /F2 8.5 Tf (102 narrow spectral bands) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf  T* (from ) Tj /F2 8.5 Tf (0.75 microns to 5.0 microns) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf (.) Tj T* ET
